Having played the game a long time ago, it's nice to be able to
offer advice.  You can engrave 'Elbereth' which will stop
monsters from attacking you.  While they won't hit you, they
can still hurl things at you and dragons can breathe fire at
you.  If you strike them, your movement will disturb the writing
and they will continue.  But you can use it to rest and recover
hit points.

